<en-export export-date="20261014T034500Z" application="Evernote" version="10.105.4">
  <note>
    <title>Bay Area Half — race plan (Oct 15)</title>
    <created>20260928T043000Z</created>
    <updated>20261014T034500Z</updated>
    <tag>race</tag>
    <tag>half-marathon</tag>
    <tag>plan</tag>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>David Barron</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Thu Oct 15, 7:00 am start. With Owen (he flies in Tue night, crashes on the incubator couch).</div><div><br/></div><div><en-media hash="67fdfeed767c27b924b12e6185611112" type="image/png"/></div><div>Course profile from the race site (sketched): flat first 6.8 mi, ~120 ft climb miles 7-8, descent mile 9, flat-ish run-in.</div><div><br/></div><h3>Goal</h3><ul><li>A: 1:24:59 or better (6:29/mi)</li><li>B: sub-1:26</li><li>C: finish strong, no blow-up on the hill</li></ul><div><br/></div><h3>Splits plan</h3><table style="border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>miles</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>pace</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"><b>notes</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">1-3</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:32-6:35</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">let Owen go. he's running 6:16s</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">4-6</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:27-6:29</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">settle, HR should be ~172</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">7-8</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">effort, not pace (6:40s ok)</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">the climb. don't chase pace</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">9</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:25</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">use the downhill, relax shoulders</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">10-13.1</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px">6:20 -&gt; whatever's left</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc;padding:4px"></td></tr></table><div><br/></div><h3>Fuel</h3><ul><li>2.5 h before: bagel + PB + banana, coffee.</li><li>Gel at mile 4.5 and mile 8.5 (caffeinated one at 8.5). water at every station, sip.</li></ul><div><br/></div><h3>Logistics</h3><ul><li>Bib pickup Wed 4-7 pm.</li><li>Leave the house 5:55.</li><li>Bag check closes 6:45.</li></ul></en-note>]]>
    </content>
